WEBVTT

00:00:00.664 --> 00:00:05.066
Menu Edit → Preferences: all the settings are here

00:00:05.066 --> 00:00:12.862
General → Language and number format: interface language, unit system (Standard mm / kg / s, or imperial), decimals

00:00:12.862 --> 00:00:20.062
Display → Navigation: change the navigation style here (CAD, Blender, Touchpad…)

00:00:20.062 --> 00:00:25.200
Click Cancel to leave without changing anything
